{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d3a5db31-1c08-8266-8f53-ea4179fd4337",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:31:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Brendan Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:28:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, good morning. I'm calling about Christmas tree pickup. I want to know if the city still takes them and when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:28:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do. Trees go out for collection in January. Is it a real tree, no stand, no lights, no plastic bag on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:06-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Real tree, yeah. It's a Fraser fir, about six feet. I took the lights off Tuesday. My wife said to me, call and make sure, and I said, it's the city, they always take them, and she said, call anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart wife. Yes, just put it out at the curb on your regular trash day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is there a fee for that? Do I need a sticker or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No fee for the tree. It's part of your regular collection, so nothing to buy. Just no bag, that's the main thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, I'm sorry, can you speak up a little? I'm on my cell and I can barely hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, is this better? I said there's no fee for the tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Whoa, no, that's too loud now. I meant softer. Sorry, I didn't say that right. You were coming in loud and kind of fuzzy, so I thought louder, but I meant softer, more gentle on the ear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. How's this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good, that's perfect. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So no fee, tree at the curb, no bag. Do you want me to look up your pickup day? I'd need your address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd help. It's 296 Kingston Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 296 Kingston Avenue. [pause] Let me pull that up. Your regular pickup there is Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Friday. So tomorrow. I had it in my head that it was Thursday, but the guy next door told me Friday and I said, are you sure, and he said, I've lived here nine years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:31:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He's right. Friday. Put it out tonight or early tomorrow morning, before the trucks come around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early tomorrow. What time do they usually start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Best bet is to have it out by seven. Sometimes they come earlier than people expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seven, okay. And if they miss it, then what, I call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's still there Saturday morning, give us a call and we'll get it noted for a pickup. But as long as it's out on time it should go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:31:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That's all I needed. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:31:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Brennan. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:31:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
